  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIGITAL MARKETING CAMPAIGN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The digital research results are the building blocks for a digital marketing campaign. This campaign defines the digital tools GNBCC needs to reach out to the target groups of companies, young entrepreneurs, women in business, and the diaspora. For instance what to use for PSD in sustainable agribusiness directed towards the young. This campaign must be developed in cooperation with experts to benefit the most and meet our goals.</narrative>
  </description>
