   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">AWARENESS CREATION AND PUBLICITY</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of the Digital Marketing Campaign was to increase awareness and publicity of GNBCC activities and projects through online, traditional, and social media channels. Additionally, the campaign aimed to promote better internal communication systems within the organization.</narrative>
   </description>
   <category code="A02"></category>
   <language code="EN"></language>
   <document-date iso-date="2024-06-30"></document-date>
  </document-link>
  <document-link format="APPLICATION/VND.OPENXMLFORMATS-OFFICEDOCUMENT.WORDPROCESSINGML.DOCUMENT" url="https://iatipublisher-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/document-link/92/IATI%20Report%20%28DMC-%20July-%20Dec%291745582337.docx">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity Report on Digital Marketing Campaign for the period July to Dec 2024</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The second half of 2024 focused on increasing awareness of GNBCC projects, strengthening visibility across our digital platforms, and reinforcing brand identity through strategic content and materials.
In Q3, emphasis was placed on content creation for ongoing projects and branding efforts. At the same time, Q4 transitioned into deeper engagement and the production of long-term resources such as the 2024 GNBCC Annual Magazine and an online brochure. Despite fewer events towards the end of the year, we maintained a strong presence online, with Instagram showing the highest growth in followership and engagement.</narrative>
   </description>
